# Copy to .env and fill in.
#
# TYPESAFE_API_KEY is read at runtime by the Rust process only
# (src-tauri/src/api.rs) — it is never inlined into the webview bundle, and
# the app must be restarted (not just rebuilt) after changing it.
TYPESAFE_API_KEY=

# Optional overrides, read by Vite at build time (see envPrefix in vite.config.ts)
# and safe to expose to the webview bundle.
# TYPESAFE_BASE_URL=https://api.typesafe.ai
# TYPESAFE_DEFAULT_MODEL=jev-latest
